WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
How do you separate sand from water?

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.550
Pour it through a filter.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.040
Sand stays in the paper.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.990
Water drips through.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:14.016
Filtering works because the grains are too big.
